{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國男神邊佑錫昨晚在香港亞洲國際博覽館舉行粉絲見面會，是他今次亞洲巡迴粉絲見面會的尾站。</p><p>他除了用廣東話講「我係邊佑錫」作自我介紹之外，又學講「煲仔飯」、「心心」、「老Best」和「BB豬」等廣東話，惹來全場尖叫。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T05:50:39.223487+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T05:32:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T05:44:03.827081+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T05:44:03.827081+00:00","content_hash":"fc8f97788c157d6b82ecf53b7765b73709bdf9314f4962b5df759f2d0f83362c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}